{
    "name": "adguardhome",
    "display_name": "AdGuard Home",
    "description": "对应海报条目：Hosts 优选 优化站点 + TMDB等访问。AdGuard Home 是全网广告拦截与隐私保护的 DNS 服务器，通过其 DNS 重写（rewrite）功能可实现自定义 hosts 效果，优化 PT 站点、TMDB 等域名的访问，同时提供广告过滤、恶意网站拦截等能力。",
    "category": "tool",
    "tags": ["工具", "DNS", "Hosts", "去广告", "开源"],
    "website": "https://adguard.com/zh_cn/adguard-home.html",
    "source_url": "https://github.com/AdguardTeam/AdGuardHome",
    "architectures": ["amd64", "arm64"],
    "image": "adguard/adguardhome",
    "default_ports": [
        {"port": 3000, "protocol": "tcp", "description": "初始化向导 / Web 管理界面"},
        {"port": 53, "protocol": "tcp", "description": "DNS 服务端口（TCP，可选映射）"},
        {"port": 53, "protocol": "udp", "description": "DNS 服务端口（UDP，可选映射）"}
    ],
    "config_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["ports", "volumes"],
        "containers": [
            {
                "name": "adguardhome",
                "title": "AdGuard Home",
                "settings": [
                    {"type": "ports", "title": "端口设置", "fields": ["ports"]},
                    {"type": "volumes", "title": "存储空间设置", "fields": ["volumes"]},
                    {"type": "env", "title": "环境变量", "fields": ["adguardhome_env"]},
                    {"type": "advanced", "title": "高级设置", "fields": ["privileged"]}
                ],
                "description": "AdGuard Home DNS 服务器"
            }
        ],
        "properties": {
            "ports": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["local_port", "container_port", "protocol"],
                    "properties": {
                        "protocol": {"enum": ["tcp", "udp"], "type": "string", "title": "协议", "default": "tcp"},
                        "local_port": {"type": "integer", "title": "本地端口", "maximum": 65535, "minimum": 1},
                        "container_port": {"type": "integer", "title": "容器端口", "maximum": 65535, "minimum": 1}
                    }
                },
                "title": "端口设置",
                "default": [
                    {"protocol": "tcp", "local_port": 3000, "container_port": 3000},
                    {"protocol": "tcp", "local_port": 53, "container_port": 53},
                    {"protocol": "udp", "local_port": 53, "container_port": 53}
                ]
            },
            "volumes": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["host_path", "container_path", "mode"],
                    "properties": {
                        "mode": {"enum": ["rw", "ro"], "type": "string", "title": "权限", "default": "rw"},
                        "host_path": {"type": "string", "title": "本地路径", "format": "directory"},
                        "container_path": {"type": "string", "title": "容器路径"}
                    }
                },
                "title": "存储空间设置",
                "default": [
                    {"mode": "rw", "host_path": "adguardhome/work", "container_path": "/opt/adguardhome/work"},
                    {"mode": "rw", "host_path": "adguardhome/conf", "container_path": "/opt/adguardhome/conf"}
                ]
            },
            "adguardhome_env": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["key", "value"],
                    "properties": {
                        "key": {"type": "string", "title": "变量名"},
                        "value": {"type": "string", "title": "值"}
                    }
                },
                "title": "环境变量",
                "default": [
                    {"key": "TZ", "value": "Asia/Shanghai"}
                ]
            },
            "privileged": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "title": "特权模式",
                "default": false,
                "description": "一般无需开启；53 端口被占用时可改用其他本地端口映射"
            }
        }
    },
    "yaml_template": "services:\n  adguardhome:\n    image: {{ image }}\n    container_name: {{ project_name }}\n    ports:\n{%- for port in ports %}\n      - \"{{ port.local_port }}:{{ port.container_port }}/{{ port.protocol }}\"\n{%- endfor %}\n    volumes:\n{%- for vol in volumes %}\n      - {{ to_host_path(vol.host_path if (vol.host_path.startswith('/') or vol.shared) else project_name ~ '/' ~ vol.host_path) }}:{{ vol.container_path }}:{{ vol.mode }}\n{%- endfor %}\n    privileged: {{ privileged | lower }}\n    restart: unless-stopped\n{%- if adguardhome_env %}\n    environment:\n{%- for item in adguardhome_env %}\n      - {{ item.key }}={{ item.value }}\n{%- endfor %}\n{%- endif %}\n",
    "readme": "# AdGuard Home\n\n对应海报条目：Hosts 优选 优化站点 + TMDB等访问。\n\nAdGuard Home 是一款全网广告拦截与隐私保护的 DNS 服务器。通过「DNS 重写」功能可以为任意域名指定解析 IP，等效于自定义 hosts，可用于优化 PT 站点、TMDB 等域名的访问速度与连通性。\n\n## 部署前准备\n\n1. 首次安装请访问 `http://<NAS-IP>:3000` 完成初始化向导（设置管理端口、账号密码）。初始化后管理界面默认运行在 80 端口，请在向导中留意或在「端口设置」中追加 80 端口映射。\n2. 53 端口（TCP/UDP）为 DNS 服务端口，若宿主机已有 DNS 服务占用（如 systemd-resolved），可将本地端口改为其他值（如 5553）或删除该映射。\n\n## 实现 Hosts 优选\n\n进入管理界面 →「过滤器」→「DNS 重写」→ 添加重写：填写域名（如 `api.themoviedb.org`）与优选 IP，保存即可。将设备或路由器的 DNS 指向本服务地址后全网生效。\n\n## 注意\n\n请妥善保管初始化时设置的管理账号密码；配置保存在 `/opt/adguardhome/conf`，已默认持久化。",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "type": "compose",
    "changelog": "初始导入",
    "backup_paths": ["/opt/adguardhome/work", "/opt/adguardhome/conf"],
    "is_builtin": false
}
